# One repo per line. Lines starting with # are ignored.
#
# Preferred VPS layout uses workstream buckets under ~/github_repos.
# Recognized buckets default to "personal ventures external" and are
# configurable via DOTFILES_REPO_BUCKETS in ~/.config/dotfiles/local.env:
#   personal owner/repo
#   ventures owner/repo
#   external owner/repo
#
# The repo field can be any gh-supported form:
#   owner/repo
#   git@github.com:owner/repo.git
#   https://github.com/owner/repo
#   https://github.com/owner/repo.git
#
# If no workstream bucket is provided, the repo is cloned directly under
# ~/github_repos. Copy this file to repos.txt and edit. repos.txt is
# gitignored so personal repo lists do not get committed.

# Examples — replace with your actual repos:
# personal owner/dotfiles
# ventures owner/some-app
# external browserbase/stagehand
